# MarketLens Environment Configuration

# ==============================================================================
# 1. Frontend (web/)
# ==============================================================================
# Backend base URL. Leave blank for the local dev proxy (Vite forwards /api to 127.0.0.1:8000).
# Set it when the frontend is served from a different origin than the API (e.g. Vercel + Render).
VITE_API_URL=

# AI provider keys (Groq, Gemini, Grok) are NOT configured here.
# Vite compiles every VITE_* variable into the public JavaScript bundle, so a key set here would be
# readable by every visitor. Paste a key into the AI Strategy Lab in the browser instead; it is kept in
# that browser's localStorage. With no key the built-in rule-based engine runs.

# ==============================================================================
# 2. Backend (backend/)
# ==============================================================================
# The backend needs no keys. Prices come from the unofficial Yahoo Finance feed, NAVs from mfapi.in,
# IPOs from the NSE website and news from Google News RSS.
#
# Optional: the code revision stamped on run receipts (Render sets RENDER_GIT_COMMIT itself).
GIT_SHA=
